h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decides}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{Decides}_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a31024701b006c36\" href=\"?note=a31024701b006c36\" title=\"27-df-turing-machine\">27-df-turing-machine</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Time}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{Time}_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fe90a43e6765ed55\" href=\"?note=fe90a43e6765ed55\" title=\"27-df-tm-runtime\">27-df-tm-runtime</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{Decides}_M(L)\\land\\forall w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;(\\mathrm{Time}_M(w)\\leq c(|w|+1)^k))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf P\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{Decides}_M(L)\\land\\forall w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;(\\mathrm{Time}_M(w)\\leq c(|w|+1)^k))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>二进制语言的确定型多项式时间类。机器、输入字串及时间均在本目录内建，不借名称假定外部模型兼容。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"a31024701b006c36","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-tm-runtime","status":"resolved","id":"fe90a43e6765ed55","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-tm-run